{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementPhaseStratification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementPhaseStratification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticle","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.DressedParticle","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Basic"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementPhaseStratification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementPhaseStratification","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L161-L168","doc":"**Confinement phase stratification (headline).** The locus `Ω(P)` is\nopen and μ is locally constant on its components — derived from the SDP\nregularity hypotheses, not assumed. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:confinement-phase-stratification","label":"prop:confinement-phase-stratification","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-phase-stratification.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phase_sigmaF_continuous_on_locus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phase_sigmaF_continuous_on_locus","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L151-L157","doc":"**Claim (3) — continuity of σ_F.** Derived from `sigmaF_continuousOn`\nafter rewriting the locus to the feasible set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phase_mu_constant_on_components","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phase_mu_constant_on_components","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L134-L147","doc":"**Claim (2) — local constancy of μ.** Derived from\n`mu_locally_constant` after rewriting the locus to the feasible set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.phase_locus_open","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.phase_locus_open","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L124-L130","doc":"**Claim (1) — Openness of the confinement locus.** Derived: the locus\nequals the strictly-feasible set, which is open. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.confinementLocus_eq_feasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.confinementLocus_eq_feasible","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L118-L122","doc":"The confinement locus coincides with the strictly-feasible set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.sigmaF_continuousOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.sigmaF_continuousOn","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L115-L115","doc":"The value data `σ_F` is continuous on the strictly-feasible set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.mu_locally_constant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.mu_locally_constant","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L111-L111","doc":"On a connected set of strictly-feasible points the active-support\ncardinality (hence `μ`) does not jump. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.feasible_isOpen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.feasible_isOpen","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L108-L108","doc":"The strictly-feasible set is open (Slater strictness is an open\ncondition when the SDP data is continuous in `q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.confined_iff_feasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.confined_iff_feasible","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L105-L105","doc":"Confinement at real `q` is exactly Slater-strict SDP feasibility. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L103-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasSDPRegularity","kind":"class","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L94-L116","doc":"**SDP regularity hypotheses** — the genuine inputs of the\nphase-stratification theorem. An instance asserts that confinement on\nthe real axis *is* Slater-strict SDP feasibility, and that this\nstrict-feasibility set is open with the value/multiplicity data locally\nregular. These are hypotheses (the \"IF\" of the stratification claim),\nnot the topological conclusions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StrictlyFeasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StrictlyFeasible","kind":"opaque","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L88-L92","doc":"**Slater-strict SDP feasibility** at real `q` — an SDP feasible\npoint exists strictly inside the positive-semidefinite cone. Opaque:\nthe strict-feasibility predicate is defined by the numerical SDP data\nat `q` (compute-only), not by a Lean closed form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.sigmaFReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.sigmaFReal","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L71-L74","doc":"Frobenius stability index `σ_F(P, q)` on the real q-axis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.muReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.muReal","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L66-L69","doc":"Binding multiplicity `μ(P, q)` on the real q-axis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.confinementLocus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.confinementLocus","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L60-L64","doc":"**Confinement locus** `Ω(P) ⊆ ℝ` — the set of real `q` at which\n`P` is confined. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.confinedReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.confinedReal","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L55-L58","doc":"Confinement predicate at real `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.sigmaF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.sigmaF","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Frobenius stability `σ_F(P, q)` at real `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.mu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.mu","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Binding multiplicity `μ(P, q)` at real `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.confined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.confined","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Confinement predicate at real `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasRealAxisData","kind":"class","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementPhaseStratification.lean#L46-L53","doc":"**Real-axis SDP data** — class-supplied evaluation maps. ","signatureChunk":0}]}